Hi all,
This is latest Yocto bug trend chart for WW10. QA tested RC1 last week and =
there are 34 new bugs submitted. Now there are 138 open bugs in bugzilla.

Note:
How we calculate the data of "weighted defect density"?
We define a weight for each severity. And the sum of these weights for all =
open bugs are the data we record in chart.
The weight we use for each severity:
Critical: 10
Major: 7
Normal: 5
Minor: 3
Enhancement: 1

Best Regards,
Jiajun

